Do you know why the tongue? No? No? Let's see if anybody knows why the tongue. Why?

cue0127669
00:15:28.988 --> 00:15:33.988
Because the tongue is the only part of the animal that you don't need to skin him first.

cue0127670
00:15:33.988 --> 00:15:38.988
You see? So he was so peculiar, so that because he saw that they were, he thought that they were tired,

cue0127671
00:15:38.988 --> 00:15:44.988
that he gives them, the first thing that he gives them is the tongue, because they don't have to wait till you skin the animal.

cue0127672
00:15:44.988 --> 00:15:56.988
You see, alright? So again, Abraham Abenu obviously didn't know at the moment that these people were angels, they were special angels of God. That is the vision of God.

cue0127673
00:15:56.988 --> 00:16:05.988
How God revealed Himself? Through these wayfarers, alright? In the way that Abraham Abenu treated them, alright? Yes?

cue0127674
00:16:05.988 --> 00:16:12.988
Did he make shihtetat? Absolutely, that's what we believe, that he made shihtetat. We have no proof, but we believe that Abraham Abenu made shihtetat.

cue0127675
00:16:12.988 --> 00:16:15.988
We believe that we observe the whole Tora.

cue0127676
00:16:15.988 --> 00:16:37.988
Yes, alright, but the point of this, of the story is not so far the Shechitah, but is the way that the concept of religion that we have, which is different, you know, again, again, our concept of God has to be implemented and reflected in our behavior towards other human beings.

cue0127677
00:16:37.988 --> 00:16:45.988
If somebody does not know how to treat another human being, he doesn't have clear in his mind what do we mean by Beselel ʾElohim asayet ha'adah.

cue0127678
00:16:45.988 --> 00:16:48.988
The whole notion of Gimlet Hasadim is so important.

cue0127679
