Gimlet Hasadim for us is not something that you do with your checkbook.

cue0127680
00:16:53.988 --> 00:16:55.988
It's something you do with your body.

cue0127681
00:16:55.988 --> 00:16:58.988
You know like ʾAbraham ʾAḇinu, he did it with his body.

cue0127682
00:16:58.988 --> 00:16:59.988
Yes, personally.

cue0127683
00:16:59.988 --> 00:17:07.988
Personally, that's the notion of Gimara Hasadim. You do Gimara Hasadim personally with your body to serve the body of another person.

cue0127684
00:17:07.988 --> 00:17:14.988
It's a direct, it's a body relationship. Yes? Of course we give sedaka with sign and check. That's nice, that's beautiful.

cue0127685
00:17:14.988 --> 00:17:18.988
But that's not Gimara Hasadim. Gimara Hasadim, that is the case of ʾAbraham ʾAḇinu.

